{title: Udja Kale Kawan Tere}
{artist: Gadar Udit Narayan Uttam Singh}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#]Udja kale kawan tere
[G#]muwich [C#]khandpanwa
[C#]Le ja tu sandesha meraa,
[G#]mai [C#]sadke jawan
[C#]Bagon me phir jhule pad gaye
[F#]Pak gayean [C#]mithiya ambiya
[C#]Yeh chhotee [F#]see jindagee de
[G#]rat [C#]lambiya lambiya
[C#]Oh ghar aaja pardesee,
[C#]kee teree meree ek jinddee
[C#]Cham cham [G#]karta aaya mausam,
[F#]pyar ke [C#]gito kaa
[C#]Raste pe ankhiya, [G#]rasta dekhe
[F#]bichde [C#]mito kaa
[C#]Saree saree rat jagaye
[F#]mujhko [C#]teree yade
[C#]Mere sare [F#]git bane me
[G#]re dil kee faryade
[C#]Oh ghar aaja pardesee,
[C#]kee teree meree ek jinddee
